        <item>
            <title>0.3.22</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:30:50 +0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>27</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.22</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Direct screenshot actions with icons

**Copy & Discard** is now its own button beside **Copy & Close**. One click copies the annotated screenshot and closes without saving to Desktop. The dropdown has been removed.

Copy, Copy & Close, Copy & Discard and Save all have icons and labels, with room to fit in the smallest window. Default 100% image sizing and zoom are retained.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/justaicode/relay-updates/releases/download/v0.3.22/Relay-0.3.22-macOS.zip" length="4246514" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ni/QQH1voxZKiHci54CcIo12Q2lfujSN63L3bx4y2teGjpoxVdAPbez1eAp6J06b3DpejGimLhlNp+flQ4o2Dw=="/>
